doc:comparisonFindings opmad:has_text_value "Spectrum-Principal-Energy-Vector improves bearing RUL prediction and represents the original data better; deep CNN further improves prediction accuracy." .
_:a47be3441cfeb8bb2b352b88a4505d43 rdf:reifies <<( doc:comparisonFindings opmad:has_text_value "Spectrum-Principal-Energy-Vector improves bearing RUL prediction and represents the original data better; deep CNN further improves prediction accuracy." )>> ;
	prov:wasDerivedFrom doc:e063e6dbbc8b .
doc:sameFeatureFindings opmad:has_text_value "With Spectrum-Principal-Energy-Vector input, deep CNN predicts each bearing better than SVM and DNN; SVM performs better than DNN. DNN suffers serious overfitting with large input scale. CNN weight sharing reduces parameters relative to the fully connected network at the same input size and network depth, largely avoiding overfitting. SVM is more suitable for small-scale data learning but lacks the ability to find deep-seated laws." .
_:bd447ec0dd350d8a0c0f79b41e9ebfa2 rdf:reifies <<( doc:sameFeatureFindings opmad:has_text_value "With Spectrum-Principal-Energy-Vector input, deep CNN predicts each bearing better than SVM and DNN; SVM performs better than DNN. DNN suffers serious overfitting with large input scale. CNN weight sharing reduces parameters relative to the fully connected network at the same input size and network depth, largely avoiding overfitting. SVM is more suitable for small-scale data learning but lacks the ability to find deep-seated laws." )>> ;
